    <briefdescription>
<para>Boundary Condition Application for Scalar PDEs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file provides functions to add boundary conditions to discrete operators and right-hand side vectors for 1D, 2D, and 3D scalar PDEs.</para>
<para>Supports:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Dirichlet boundary conditions (a0 ≠ 0, b0 = 0)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Neumann boundary conditions (a0 = 0, b0 ≠ 0)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Robin boundary conditions (a0 ≠ 0, b0 ≠ 0)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Periodic boundary conditions (a0 = 0, b0 = 0)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>date 2025/01/26 date modified 2026/02/26 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
